streetCryptid Windows repeater

The app, the Windows service and the Rust host are part of the streetCryptid repository, licensed
under AGPL-3.0-or-later (LICENSE). The host is built on the repeater server crate (trail-stash)
and the roster/wire crate it shares with the phone, both in the same repository:

https://github.com/unrealJune/streetCryptid/tree/main/repeater

The host is built against noq 1.4.0 with one fix (MIT OR Apache-2.0), from third_party/noq in that
repository; its NOTICE lists the modification.

Rajdhani and IBM Plex Mono font license notices are bundled in Assets.
The animated lattice is adapted from this project's onboarding splash design.
The icon is the streetCryptid mothman sigil (assets/images/mothman-logo.svg),
rendered by scripts/make-icons.py.
